# A port whose promise is its local tick, beside a peer of another span:
# console 1 at 60000/1001 frames a second promises no step ahead, so each
# of its steps waits for a grant to the tick it has promised, and the last
# stretch of its frame for one to its frame-end tick. Console 0 at
# 16777216/280896 promises eight steps ahead.
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_fps 16777216/280896
option 0 link_test_rate_0 16777216
option 0 link_test_lookahead_0 8
option 1 link_test_fps 60000/1001
option 1 link_test_rate_0 60000
option 1 link_test_lookahead_0 0
0 cable 0:0 1:0
150 save mid
300 end
